# MANAGED by EpiAwarePackageTools.scaffold — do not edit by hand.
# Normalise line endings so checkouts are byte-identical across platforms.
# Without this, a Windows runner with core.autocrlf can check out CRLF
# source, and JuliaFormatter's `overwrite = false` check (and other
# line-sensitive tooling) reports spurious differences.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
